---
// ANU-styled site chrome, shared by every page. This is NOT the official ANU
// crest: it's a wordmark in the brand's colours, carried above a visible
// "unofficial student prototype" tag so a visitor never mistakes it for a real
// ANU service. The brand palette is black and white with ANU gold (#BE830E)
// used sparingly as a highlight; see styles.css.
---
<header class="site-header">
  <div class="utility">
    <p class="tag">Unofficial student prototype &middot; COMP4020</p>
  </div>
  <div class="bar">
    <a class="wordmark" href="/">
      <span class="crest">ANU</span>
      <span class="product">Campus Parking</span>
    </a>
    <nav aria-label="site">
      <a href="/">Parking</a>
      <a href="/readme/">About</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
  <div class="gold-rule"></div>
</header>
